                    "sense_definition": "Present participle and gerund of <w>tear</w>.",
                    "learner_level": "B1",
                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She is <w>tearing</w> the old letter into small pieces.",
